aiśvarya nirvāhikātasyā bhāvābhāvasyābhyāṃ ayam śaktiḥ | ayamaśakta iti 
lokepi pratī nirdṛśyate | tasyācāraḥ puruṣanūpaḥ matvāviti tato bidbhuḥ prakṛti 
puruṣātmakaḥ aṃkārasvarūpaḥ śivaśaktimayaḥ sākṣāt tridhā saubhidyate punaḥ 
| 

biṃdunādo bījamiti tasya bheddāḥ sanīritāḥ |
